      "targeting": "Minion, does not count towards creep score",
      "onhit": "Mist Walkers' attacks are mitigated by dodge, block, and blind. They also deal 60% damage against monsters and 50% damage against turrets.",
      "spelleffects": "Mist Walkers' basic attacks apply spell effects as area damage, including leaping to marked enemies.",
      "protection": "Mist Walkers receive 60% damage from lane minions; 66% – 40% (based on level) damage from area of effect abilities; 200% damage from melee champion basic attacks; and they are instantly killed by a turret shot.",
      "abilities": ";Endless March\nMist Walkers remain near Yorick (preferably 200 units behind him) until they enter combat in a lane, whereupon they proceed along the lane and attack any enemy in their path.\n\n;Frenzied\nWhile within 1500 units of an enemy marked as Cursed by Mourning Mist, Mist Walkers benefit from the ability's bonus movement speed, and have the ability to leap to marked enemy champions and large monsters, dealing 100% of their AD upon arrival. While Mist Walkers are targeting a unit due to this effect, an exclamation mark indicator will be visible over their head.\n\n;Hasted\nWhile Mist Walkers are within 1600 units of Yorick, they gain 60 bonus movement speed and benefit from Yorick's flat movement speed bonuses. Phase Rush is a percentual exception. Summons gain bonus movement speed when returning to Yorick. This movement speed bonus is based on the distance between Yorick and the summon.",
      "notes": "* If Mist Walkers are attacking a jungle monster when Yorick casts Recall, they will continue attacking it until his channel completes, after which they withdraw to him, or they die.\n* Unlike other pets, Mist Walkers are not prioritized by turrets over siege minions, though they are prioritized over the Maiden of the Mist.\n* Mist Walkers will level up with Yorick when he does.\n* Mist Walkers will blink to Yorick's location after he completes a Teleport channel.\n* The attacks of Mist Walkers belong to separate cast instances.\n* The damage done by the Mist Walkers leap shares a cast instance with Mourning Mist."
    }
  },
